   'Co-trimoxazole is renally excreted; renal impairment increases the toxicity risk (including hyperkalaemia) and requires adjustment.',
   'Ajustar a dose; vigiar função renal e caliemia.',
   'Adjust the dose; monitor renal function and serum potassium.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Cotrimoxazol: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=08500fcb-dbec-4ac2-91c3-189d27907ec0', 'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Co-trimoxazole label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=08500fcb-dbec-4ac2-91c3-189d27907ec0', 1),
  ('levofloxacina', 'tendinopatia', 'Tendinopatia / rutura tendinosa', 'Tendinopathy / tendon rupture', 'precaution', 'moderate',
